---
const cases = [
  {
    big: true,
    img: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626785774573-4b799315345d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80',
    alt: 'Proyecto de branding Lumen Cosmética',
    cat: 'Branding · Web',
    title: 'Lumen Cosmética',
    year: "'26",
  },
  {
    img: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80',
    alt: 'Diseño web Nido Inmobiliaria',
    cat: 'Diseño web',
    title: 'Nido Inmobiliaria',
    year: "'25",
  },
  {
    img: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617474-5b21e879e113?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80',
    alt: 'Campaña social Café Aurora',
    cat: 'Social · Ads',
    title: 'Café Aurora',
    year: "'25",
  },
];
---

<section class="section work" id="trabajo">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Trabajo seleccionado</span>
        <h2>Proyectos recientes</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Una muestra de lo que hemos construido con marcas que se atrevieron a destacar.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="work-grid">
      {cases.map(c => (
        <article class:list={['case reveal', { big: c.big }]}>
          <img src={c.img} alt={c.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div class="case-meta">
            <div>
              <span class="cat">{c.cat}</span>
              <h3>{c.title}</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="yr">{c.year}</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.work {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--cream);
}
.work .eyebrow     { color: #8C8DFF; }
.work .sec-head h2 { color: var(--cream); }
.work .sec-head p  { color: rgba(251,250,246,.6); }

.work-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 22px;
}

.case {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: var(--radius-card);
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 11;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.case img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1);
  filter: saturate(1.05);
}
.case:hover img { transform: scale(1.06); }

.case-meta {
  position: absolute;
  inset: auto 0 0 0;
  padding: 26px;
  background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(20,19,15,.9), transparent);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.case-meta h3  { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); color: var(--cream); }
.case-meta .cat {
  display: block;
  font-size: .78rem;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #8C8DFF;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.case-meta .yr {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  color: rgba(251,250,246,.6);
  font-size: .95rem;
}

.case.big {
  grid-column: span 2;
  aspect-ratio: 21 / 9;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .work-grid          { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .case.big           { grid-column: span 1; aspect-ratio: 16 / 11; }
}
</style>
